# Headless Java runtime: everything needed to RUN Java (servers,
# Gradle workers, Android build tools) without the compiler toolchain.
# Paths are PKGDEST-relative: the kit lives under
# usr/lib/jvm/java-17-openjdk, with usr/bin entry points. The main
# openjdk17 package keeps the rest (javac, jar, jlink, headers,
# jmods, release, legal). Unlisted payload stays in main by splitter
# design; man pages ride the automatic -doc split.
usr/lib/jvm/java-17-openjdk/bin/java
usr/lib/jvm/java-17-openjdk/bin/keytool
usr/lib/jvm/java-17-openjdk/conf
usr/lib/jvm/java-17-openjdk/lib
usr/bin/java
usr/bin/keytool
